# About

Public-facing Shiny app for the Australian aquaculture infrastructure
dataset. This version deliberately does **not** include lease boundaries -
some state custodians (QLD, NT) don't allow those to be shared publicly, so
to keep one app that's safe to publish everywhere, leases are left out
entirely and this only shows what our satellite pipeline actually detected.

**Reads:** `output_data/summaries/AU_infrastructure_public.gpkg`

- Layer `infrastructure` - one row per detected structure (pond, longline,
  cage). No lease_id, no licence holder info, nothing that traces back to
  an individual operator.

